        "original_id": "2cc213d4-2e21-54bb-8b87-de74e73d2a33",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Max Carl, Denis \"Snake\" Bélanger\n- Organizations: Voivod\n- Products: Bone Against Steel\n- Roles: singer, keyboardist, guitarist, songwriter, vocalist, lyricist\n\nFacts:\n- Max Carl Gronenthal was born on January 29, 1950, and he is an American rock singer, keyboardist, guitarist, and songwriter.\n- Denis \"Snake\" Bélanger was born on August 9, 1964, and he is the vocalist and lyricist of the Canadian heavy metal band Voivod.\n- Bone Against Steel was the last album to feature vocalist and keyboard player Max Carl.\n- Bone Against Steel was the band's last album until its 1996 comeback.",
